      <div class="legal-doc__intro">
        <p>At Langmate, we care about your privacy. We have written this Privacy Policy to be transparent in the way we process your data, and make as easy as possible for you to understand our privacy practice and services.</p>
        <p>Langmate is a Japanese application for mobile and tablets aim to connect Japanese users and people all around the world, and provides a fun way to learn new languages, discover new cultures, and make international friends, directly with locals.</p>
        <p>Langmate provides user profile search, matching, and messaging services.</p>
        <p>When you use these services, you will share some information with us. We want to make it clear what information we collect, why we collect it, how we use it, who we share it with, and the controls we give you to access, update and delete your information.</p>
        <p>That's why we've written this Privacy Policy. We tried to write it in simple language with minimal legal jargon so that it's easy for you to understand.</p>
